-- ============================================================
-- J-MUSE Seed Data (DEVELOPMENT ONLY)
-- Run after schema.sql and policies.sql, in the Supabase SQL Editor
-- (SQL Editor runs as a privileged role so it can insert into auth.users).
--
-- Creates 10 demo users (password: "password123" for all of them),
-- 12 artists, 12 albums, 32 songs, 16 posts, 22 answers, 6 playlists
-- and a handful of likes so the home/community/trending pages are
-- never empty during development.
--
-- Artist / song names reference real J-POP acts for realism; no
-- copyrighted lyrics or audio are included (preview_url is null –
-- the player runs in demo mode). Artwork/avatars use picsum.photos /
-- pravatar.cc placeholder images. DO NOT run against production.
-- ============================================================

